@title EMC fix-it: the previewed fix drawn before and after in the 3D EMC view
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Check > EMC check, Preview on the painted-plate finding, "In 3D" opens the 3D view with the EMC layer and a banner with Before / After, Apply and Cancel. After draws the cabinet with the fix (good bond), Before as it is; nothing changes until Apply. The pictures are the evidence (drawn overlays).
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-bonding.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
scroll 360 400 -300
wait 10
click_text "Preview: Scrape the mounting area bare" #1
wait 10
click_text "In 3D"
wait 40
expect "Previewing a fix"
expect "Showing the cabinet as it would be"
shot 01-after
check_layout
click_text Before #1
wait 20
expect "Showing the cabinet as it is"
shot 02-before
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)" #1
wait 20
expect_not "Previewing a fix"
shot 03-applied
check_layout
